    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφᾰν-ιστής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destroyer,</i> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.828f
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				175
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>scavenger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				2.387.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφᾰν-ίστρια</span></b> , Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.487
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφᾰν-ιστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i>causing to disappear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					33.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.63
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Crito
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.447
			</span></i>; <i>destroying,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				145
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.220
			</span></i>, al.</div>
